# Browser profiles and renders left behind by headless-browser runs.
# `python tools/clean_scratch.py` removes them. Both naming schemes are
# listed: the CDP recipe in CLAUDE.md has used `edge-profile-<task>/`
# inside .browser-check/ since 2026-08-26, and that directory reached
# 3.8 GB while matching nothing here (T99).
.browser-check/
edgeprof*/
chromeprof*/
edge-profile*/
chrome-profile*/

# Local working state, not part of the project
junoview_project.json
semantic_project.json

# Scratch renders
scratch_*.html
*_spliced.html
